{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026y2TH32yZeG1793262111.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>保安局局長鄧炳強表示，回應宏福苑火災報告，將嚴控消防裝置關閉失效，大型維修聯合巡查，裝置不能運作可發停工令。另外，將加強監管承辦商，提升特大火警應變，研發新救援策略及科技裝備。亦會推動消防法例改革，優化投訴機制，消防處落實「兜底」責任，成立聯合特遣組嚴打圍標。</p><p></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203520-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E9%9D%A9%E6%96%B0%E6%B6%88%E9%98%B2%E8%99%95%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94%E6%9E%B6%E6%A7%8B%E8%B7%A8%E9%83%A8%E9%96%80%E7%89%B9%E9%81%A3%E9%9A%8A%E6%89%93%E6%93%8A%E5%9C%8D%E6%A8%99%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告‧全面改革｜革新消防處組織架構　跨部門特遣隊打擊圍標｜一文看清</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:47.505118+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.599704+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:21.997292+00:00","content_hash":"e1778fe45ef064ac061faee119ef7f72e9e2981d1bc923f5a27da9565185672a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:47.505118+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}